orded two summary 403s, so check whether the frontier should ever have included this scope.\n\nThe synthetic qualification scripted the session and scope answers, so it could not see this. Base the corrected route list on a real read: the session and scopes that the earlier J4 inspect and S1 phases actually read.\n\nNext: a narrow successor observer that reads only what a room session can read, with the private observation run kept unchanged and a new run directory. The checker reviews the diff from this source. Release one command, and I run it once.","body":{"no_git_artifact":"true","stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:437b1eb400ba2291aaee23a91900c95c622a4ecf stale; retired bases: git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:01e0dd696d953e8a4209c9e0a7461afc19c30b9a, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:043d587ef18b62fdeee6b57f8968de1567206697, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:070231aadcb17348891458bc2eedb5bbf529860c, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:171f5f57d26458ff1e85c1f9e0a69fefb342bc9b and 19 more","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}